wait 3
# main: web01's site on the left with two marked files, backup01's copy of
# it on the right. The panes start in folders: F2 goes to the node list,
# which starts with this node (ops01), then by name.
keys f2 home down down down down enter
wait 1
keys down down down enter
wait 1
keys tab f2 home down enter
wait 1
keys down down enter
wait 1
keys down enter
wait 1
keys down enter
wait 1
keys tab down down down down insert insert
wait 0.5
shot fkbr-main
keys f5
wait 0.5
shot fkbr-copy
keys esc
wait 0.5
# db01's dumps and backup01's archive; jobs panel focused
keys f2 home down down down enter
wait 1
keys down down enter
wait 1
keys down down
keys tab f2 home down enter
wait 1
keys down enter
wait 1
keys down down enter
wait 1
keys tab
keys f9
shot fkbr-jobs
# the viewer: build01's build config, highlighted
keys esc f2 home down down enter
wait 1
keys down down down enter
wait 1
keys down down down f3
wait 1
# scrolled a little way in: the percentage and the scrollbar show where
keys down down down down down down down down down down down down
shot fkbr-view
# the editor (Ctrl+E): found <keep> with Ctrl+W, 14 changed to 30, not saved
keys ctrle ctrlw
type keep
keys enter right right right right right del del
type 30
shot fkbr-edit
keys esc n
wait 0.5
# the settings dialog (F11), a few rows down: the demo's ~/.fkbr.conf
keys esc f11
wait 0.5
keys down down down down
shot fkbr-settings
keys esc
